{"crw-nogi-33617":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつかれちゃん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近 95年組で話す機会が増えたよ．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/07/29/8844720/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木の95年組はこの3人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しむ時は楽しむ，でもやる時はやろう‼︎．って考えが強い3人です♫  よく仕事の話とかするよ！\nそれとパフォーマンスとかliveの話とかね...   それぞれ違った3人だけど似てるとこ似ていて最近仲良くしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私，まあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/07/29/8844720/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやはここ最近もずっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「まには今日もお洒落だね(*^^*)」と褒めてくれるよ．まあやらぶよ～．ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして，大阪城ホールでのサプライズで祝って頂いた時の～♫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/07/29/8844720/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場が私のサイリウムカラー，赤と白に...♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2016/07/29/8844720/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"liveが始まる前に裏でスタンバイしていると，会場全体からろってぃーコールが聞こえました！！！"},{"type":"break"